    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/1f96e2be717a9299c2851ce273a64ec8.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you stop time, dodging attacks or evading enemies is entirely up to you. Anticipate, freeze, counterattack, and experience dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/18f673a267ec455394eb45e87e869d09.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grow infinitely stronger by replaying the game. Level up in an instant and feel the thrill of overcoming your limits as you acquire powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/be4ec9b7ef6a944a294a62472ff836be.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Start with basic training weapons and gradually acquire increasingly powerful arms. From melee blades to ranged firearms, a wide variety of weapon types unveil ever more diverse abilities, turning your limitless progression into a truly rewarding collection experience. Gather higher-grade, rarer gear\u2014and don\u2019t forget to enhance your favorite weapons so they grow alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f984803b67353c0e4460ac4b94596cde.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock and upgrade a roster of unique, voxel-crafted characters. Free each hero\u2019s signature skills to craft bespoke builds, then leverage their equipment-specific special abilities to conquer higher levels by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey to correct past mistakes and build a new future begins now.\u00a0Are you ready to save the world in just 30 seconds?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/1f96e2be717a9299c2851ce273a64ec8.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f31990022ef330dfbadafb8f1ca78b1f.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you stop time, dodging attacks or evading enemies is entirely up to you. Anticipate, freeze, counterattack, and experience dynamic action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/18f673a267ec455394eb45e87e869d09.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/b4e279b4f0a54def20132d37751e158a.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grow infinitely stronger by replaying the game. Level up in an instant and feel the thrill of overcoming your limits as you acquire powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/be4ec9b7ef6a944a294a62472ff836be.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/529aed8888e2e0a1259c03c13b58f6e2.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Start with basic training weapons and gradually acquire increasingly powerful arms. From melee blades to ranged firearms, a wide variety of weapon types unveil ever more diverse abilities, turning your limitless progression into a truly rewarding collection experience. Gather higher-grade, rarer gear\u2014and don\u2019t forget to enhance your favorite weapons so they grow alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/f984803b67353c0e4460ac4b94596cde.webp?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.poster.avif?t=1753234151\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.webm?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697940/extras/81261ada0269555f5367797478bd6528.mp4?t=1753234151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock and upgrade a roster of unique, voxel-crafted characters. Free each hero\u2019s signature skills to craft bespoke builds, then leverage their equipment-specific special abilities to conquer higher levels by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey to correct past mistakes and build a new future begins now.\u00a0Are you ready to save the world in just 30 seconds?</p>",
